id: current_info_boundary_zh_movies
description: |
  DISABLED: asserts boundary fallback that only fires when
  PA_OPENAI_AGENT_API_KEY is NOT bound. Production has the secret bound, so
  this assertion would always fail. Boundary path stays covered by unit
  tests in @pa/pa-orchestrator. To re-enable for offline runs, unset the
  secret and rename to .yaml.
locale: zh-CN
agentId: default
participant: "+19999990006"
chatId: "iMessage;+19999990006"
turnTimeoutMs: 30000
turns:
  - user: "不需要，我还想去看看电影，最近有啥电影"
    assert:
      reply_min_length: 1
      reply_contains_any: ["实时检索", "实时数据源"]
      reply_not_contains_any: ["速度与激情10", "银河护卫队3", "小美人鱼", "error", "failed", "undefined", "[20"]
